# MarketLens AI — Implementation Plan

Build a professional, production-ready AI-powered stock analytics platform with a Next.js frontend, FastAPI backend, and Python ML engine.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a very large project.** I propose building it in **4 phases** to keep progress visible and allow you to review each milestone. Each phase builds on the previous one and results in a working, demoable state.

> [!WARNING]
> **API Keys**: Alpha Vantage and Finnhub require free API keys. Yahoo Finance (`yfinance`) works without a key. I'll wire up Yahoo Finance first and make the others configurable via environment variables. Please provide API keys when ready, or I'll use mock/demo data where needed.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Tailwind CSS 4**: The latest Tailwind is v4. Your spec says "Tailwind CSS" — I'll use **Tailwind CSS v4** with the Next.js integration. Confirm if you'd prefer v3 instead.

